Transient-value retention probes
binary=./zig-out/bin/1z   iterations=500000   mode=--compile=off

probe                      tracked_MB   bytes/it       rss_MB
------------------------ ------------ ---------- ------------
1 2 + drop                        0.0          0          0.2
H{ } @set drop                    0.0          0          0.1
{ } #append drop                  0.0          0          0.2
>string drop                      0.0          0          0.0
string #append drop               0.0          0          0.2
array #append drop                0.0          0          0.1
#map #collect drop                0.0          0          0.2
>symbol drop                      0.0          0          0.0
>duration drop                    0.0          0          0.1
bignum + drop                     0.0          0          0.1
curry drop                        0.0          0          0.2
